.TH HOMELAB-SSO-UI 8 "2026-07-31" "homelab-sso-ui" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
homelab-sso-ui \- Homelab SSO login service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-sso-ui
.br
(started via
.B hypnotoad
under the
.B homelab-sso-ui.service
systemd unit; not normally invoked directly)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B homelab-sso-ui
implements a small OAuth2 authorization-code flow
.RI ( /oauth/authorize ", " /oauth/token ", " /oauth/userinfo )
as a thin wrapper around
.BR homelab-api (8) 's
existing login and JWT machinery. The OAuth "access_token" issued to
clients
.B is
the homelab-api JWT itself \- this service does not mint or persist its
own tokens beyond a short-lived (60 second), one-time authorization code
held in memory.
.P
Consumers (Roundcube, and eventually
.BR homelab-drive-web-ui )
delegate their login screens to this service instead of checking
credentials themselves. Roundcube in particular has native OAuth2 login
support that works against this service with no custom plugin.
.P
It runs as a Mojolicious application under Hypnotoad and is managed via
systemd; it is not intended to be run interactively.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/homelab/sso-ui/config.yml
Main configuration file (YAML). See CONFIGURATION below.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HOMELAB_SSO_UI_CONFIG
Overrides the path to the configuration file (default
.IR /etc/homelab/sso-ui/config.yml ).
Set by the shipped systemd unit.
.TP
.B HOMELAB_SSO_UI_HOME
Overrides the base directory used to locate templates
.RI ( templates/ )
and static assets
.RI ( public/ ).
Default:
.IR /usr/share/homelab-sso-ui .
Set by the shipped systemd unit; useful for running from a source
checkout during development.
.SH CONFIGURATION
.SS homelab_api
.TP
.B base_url
Base URL of the
.B homelab-api
instance this service authenticates users against and validates tokens
through. No default \- required.
.SS clients
A list of OAuth2 clients permitted to use this SSO service. Each entry
has:
.TP
.B client_id
Identifier the client sends in
.I /oauth/authorize
and
.IR /oauth/token .
.TP
.B client_secret
Shared secret the client must present at
.I /oauth/token
to exchange an authorization code for a token. No default \- required
per client; use a long random value.
.TP
.B redirect_uri
The exact URI this service will redirect back to after a successful
login for this client. Requests naming a
.B client_id
whose registered
.B redirect_uri
does not match exactly are rejected before any login form is shown.
.SS server
Hypnotoad listen/worker configuration.
.TP
.B listen
Full listen URL, e.g.
.IR http://0.0.0.0:2502 .
Default:
.IR http://127.0.0.1:2502 .
Deliberately different from
.BR homelab-api 's
default
.RI ( 3000 )
and
.BR homelab-drive-web-ui 's
default
.RI ( 2501 ),
so all three can coexist on one host (e.g. for local/dev testing)
without a port collision.
.TP
.B workers
Number of Hypnotoad worker processes. Default:
.IR 1 .
.B Must stay at 1
unless the in-memory one-time authorization code store is replaced with
a shared backing store \- a code minted by one worker process is not
visible to another.
.TP
.B pid_file
Path to the Hypnotoad PID file. Default:
.IR /var/lib/homelab/sso-ui-hypnotoad.pid .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR homelab-api (8)
.P
Full example configuration:
.I /usr/share/homelab-sso-ui/config/sso-ui.example.yml
